# CLCKD — optional local configuration. Defaults work without an env file.
# Copy to `.env.local` only if needed. Never commit real values.
# No API keys, remote database or preconfigured owner credentials are required.
# Next.js sets NODE_ENV for dev/build/start; do not pin it here.
# Host and port default to 127.0.0.1:3300 in the npm scripts.
# SQLite and the one-time setup code use this directory; use an absolute path
# or a path relative to the repository root. Keep private runtime data ignored.
# CLCKD_DB_PATH=./data/app.db
